Nonhumanoid	KEY:NONHUMANOID	TYPE:Armor		COST:BASECOST*(((SIZE<=2)*.5)+(SIZE==3)+(SIZE==4)+((SIZE>=5)*(2^(SIZE-4))))	VISIBLE:QUALIFY			SOURCEPAGE:H

